### Real-World Example 1: Gainwell Go Mobile App Dashboard

**Context**: Gainwell Go member mobile app serves members across multiple states. Dashboard displays comprehensive member information requiring data from 6 microservices. Initial implementation had clients making 6 separate API calls, resulting in 3-5 second load times and poor app store ratings with complaints about slowness.

**Before Implementation** (Client-Side Orchestration):
```javascript
// Mobile app React Native code
const loadDashboard = async (memberId) => {
  setLoading(true);
  try {
    // 6 sequential API calls
    const member = await api.get(`/members/${memberId}`);
    const eligibility = await api.get(`/eligibility/${memberId}/current`);
    const claims = await api.get(`/claims?memberId=${memberId}&limit=5`);
    const providers = await api.get(`/providers/assigned?memberId=${memberId}`);
    const appointments = await api.get(`/appointments?memberId=${memberId}&upcoming=true`);
    const carePlans = await api.get(`/care-plans/${memberId}/active`);

    setDashboardData({ member, eligibility, claims, providers, appointments, carePlans });
  } catch (error) {
    // Complex error handling for 6 potential failure points
    showError("Unable to load dashboard");
  } finally {
    setLoading(false);
  }
};
```

**Challenges**:
- Average load time: 3.2 seconds on WiFi, 5.8 seconds on cellular
- 6 HTTP connections with TLS handshakes = 4.5-6 KB overhead
- Mobile data consumption: 35-40 KB per dashboard load
- Complex error handling in mobile client
- Poor user experience, negative reviews

**After Implementation** (Composed API):
```javascript
// Simplified mobile app code
const loadDashboard = async (memberId) => {
  setLoading(true);
  try {
    // Single API call to composed endpoint
    const dashboard = await api.get(`/api/mobile/members/${memberId}/dashboard`);
    setDashboardData(dashboard);
  } catch (error) {
    if (error.status === 206) {
      // Partial content - display available data
      setDashboardData(error.data);
      showWarning("Some information temporarily unavailable");
    } else {
      showError("Unable to load dashboard");
    }
  } finally {
    setLoading(false);
  }
};
```

**Results**:
- **Load time improvement**: Multi-second loads reduced to sub-second on WiFi and cellular
- **Network overhead reduction**: Payload size substantially reduced through composed responses
- **Mobile data savings**: Reduced data transfer across user base
- **App store rating**: Improved after addressing slowness complaints
- **Client code reduction**: 200+ lines of orchestration → 30 lines
- **Backend efficiency**: Server-side caching substantially reduced backend calls

